Create, merge, inspect status, and deliver pull requests on Forgejo and GitHub directly from your workspace repository.

Usage:
  orbit pr [command]

Available Commands:
  create      Create a new pull request on Forgejo or GitHub
  deliver     Deliver branch end-to-end: push, PR, merge, checkout base, fast-forward, and prune
  merge       Merge a pull request on Forgejo or GitHub
  status      List open pull requests for the repository

Flags:
      --dir string     Path to repository directory (default: current directory) (default ".")
  -h, --help           help for pr
      --token string   Forgejo API access token
      --url string     Custom Forgejo/Gitea base URL

Global Flags:
      --config string   Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

Use "orbit pr [command] --help" for more information about a command.
